  "description": "Read-only MCP server for SQL Server 2017+ introspection and querying.\n      Exposes schema metadata, DDL definitions, dependency graphs, index health diagnostics,\n      data profiling and data queries via the Model Context Protocol (stdio transport),\n      enabling AI assistants such as GitHub Copilot and Claude to understand your database\n      structure without storing credentials in the repository.\n      Zero-config for .NET projects: automatically reads ConnectionStrings from\n      appsettings.json, web.config and App.config.",
